# BS-Claw reproducible source delivery
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/*.log
**/*.pyc
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/node_modules/

# Credentials and local account material
**/测试账号.txt
**/*credential*.txt
**/*credentials*.json

# Runtime databases and IPC
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.sqlite3-shm
**/sqlite-ipc/
**/ipc/

# Browser profiles, caches, logs, evidence, and generated runs
_portmanager-profiles/
**/browser-profiles/
**/runtime/
**/logs/*
!**/logs/README.md
**/data/test-runs/
**/tests/runtime/
**/tests/data/
**/audit-evidence/
**/maintenance-audits/
**/backups/
**/data/migrations/backup-*/

# PortManager runtime facts; keep only the empty bootstrap files
PortManager-Phase1/data/*
!PortManager-Phase1/data/README.md
!PortManager-Phase1/data/ports.json

# HuiceLoginAgent never publishes runtime state
HuiceLoginAgent/data/
